Hikari Obfuscator (Original)
----------------------------
Original author: Naville Zhang (https://github.com/Naville)
Repository: https://github.com/HikariObfuscator/Hikari (archived)
The original Hikari project introduced LLVM-based obfuscation passes including
string encryption, control flow flattening, bogus control flow, and more.

Hikari-LLVM15
-------------
Maintainer: 61bcdefg / NeHyci
Repositories (no longer available):
  - https://github.com/61bcdefg/Hikari-LLVM15
  - https://github.com/NeHyci/Hikari-LLVM15
  - https://github.com/61bcdefg/Hikari-LLVM15-Core
  - https://github.com/61bcdefg/Hikari-LLVM15-Headers

Hikari-LLVM15 extended the original Hikari project with support for newer
LLVM versions (15.x through 18.x) and additional obfuscation features.

Mirror
------
This mirror is maintained to preserve the source code after the original
repositories became unavailable. No additional modifications have been made
beyond de-submoduling and documentation updates.

